        "answer": {
          "short": "$441,\\ 294$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total parts}&=3+2=5\\\\\\text{One part}&=735\\div5=147\\\\\\text{First share}&=3\\times147=441\\\\\\text{Second share}&=2\\times147=294\\end{align*}$$",
