          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total parts}&=4+5+6=15\\\\\\text{One part}&=735\\div15=49\\\\\\text{First share}&=4\\times49=196\\\\\\text{Second share}&=5\\times49=245\\\\\\text{Third share}&=6\\times49=294\\end{align*}$$",
